    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae Welcome to the Most Explosive Game Night Ever!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends were just vibing on a peaceful island evening\u2026 until chaos struck. Someone found a <i>bomb</i> hidden in the attic\u2014and instead of calling for help, they went completely bonkers and tried to <i>stick it on your back</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s when everything changed.<br><strong>This isn\u2019t just game night anymore\u2026 this is <i>You Better Run</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca3 Run. Dodge. Betray. Repeat.<br>Things are about to <i>blow up</i>\u2014literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd17 LAN MULTIPLAYER MADNESS</strong><br>Gather your crew on a local network and jump into non-stop fun! Perfect for parties, game nights, or just burning bridges with your closest friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddea WILD ABILITIES &amp; CHAOTIC COMBOS</strong><br>Strategize (or just spam) your way to victory with absurd power-ups that turn the tide in seconds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Molotov Cocktail</strong> \u2013 Light it up and block the path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Ice Freeze</strong> \u2013 Chill your enemies, then dash past them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2623\ufe0f <strong>Toxic Gas</strong> \u2013 Leave behind a nasty surprise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Dash</strong> \u2013 Outrun, outplay, outlast.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc14 THE ANGRY CHICKEN RETURNS</strong><br>Oh, and did we mention the chicken? Yeah\u2026 try not to tick it off. It <i>will</i> slow you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the madness, betray your friends, and become the last one standing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong><i>You Better Run</i></strong>\u2014the island where friendship meets frenzy.</p>",
